<description>&lt;p&gt;Explosives attacks on the Colombia-Venezuela border have wounded at least four police officers, while a bomb blast near the same frontier injured additional officers. Miguel Castellanos, a former security chief, was shot dead in a political assassination, and a separate extortion-linked assault in Colombia killed at least six people. Colombian forces have killed ten ELN guerrillas in Cauca and another ten in a separate operation, and President De la Espriella announced the death of two ELN leaders. The United States will deploy more than 300 military personnel for two weeks of joint exercises along the Venezuelan frontier. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNdUt6TllDZVlCNjFIZF9KS3Ywb2N3NFN1R1h1RS02WHpxbHBobHA0c1BqWE5GQjkwclF5RkZtenMxRmd5TVZOcE1XdVMzYURXeUhmcXdhbkFsWlV2ekNZclM1NWM5QXFSTzdFdzczSWY3eXdiQ0t3NWlZdnlBSTZJZy0zd3pDMjdGekZaUlpQcjJ1WkROeWRsT1QteVBybU5HdFVRUkdtSkR1ZHp4UVVNbXQybTJyRDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Los Angeles Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQUS14YnE1YWlfUXpwNW5oVjRKbTVGR0ZOZmQ2eWZjRlhibG93MlV2SWhuQVQtc253OWNpeDFBRkdJRlpmZTMzOFZoeEo2cXVrMTVXZ3lOckZ0SHZqZ2I1cG1TM0tWRmVxYkJPcUc4SWhCNm1nci1yVV9WbDFsV09CYzZ0UC10OVBlSmFoa2J2bEg3OTFCcGc0N2ozdTJOZlpsZ2xB?oc=5&quot;&gt;ColombiaOne.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOMXhFNXR2SWZUVWFHdGsyNldKaTR2SDFtZEF1MWlZZ3Rud25LaDAwNE9WX3dfU1V1dHZxaDhiRVlvTHNIVWt1WElaVC1BQzJwbDRkakZiMUxGQmZyTE9Yb2EydFFXeUJGbjJQVXNFVnNVN3d5cHhCQ0ZVdEp6M0xqUUE5VTdGUFk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNVXVoN2lBLW1KSmVzUnlOMno